  "scope": "A fresh, single-control-plane Kind cluster using the digest-pinned node image declared by reference/lab.py. Checks kubeadm's live etcd command, proves the stock health-check certificate can perform endpoint health, and verifies that certificate-less TLS 1.3 handshakes to the cluster-owned client (2379) and peer (2380) sockets are rejected after server-certificate verification. Also reads the Kubernetes API readiness endpoint. It does not establish multi-member peer traffic, arbitrary-client denial across every possible listener, production deployment, managed-service controls, certificate rotation/revocation, or etcd RBAC authorization.",
